    "text": "The value of the integral $\\int_{-1 / 2}^{1 / 2}\\left\\{\\left(\\frac{x+1}{x-1}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{x-1}{x+1}\\right)^{2}-2\\right\\}^{1 / 2} d x$ is equal to"
